    "50 measured rounds per shape and version; calibration rounds excluded from percentiles",
    "5 percent predeclared budgets; confidence intervals are paired bootstrap across 10 independent process pairs",
    "non-child/coalesced heads and invalidated preparations use original locked fallback; their hold reduction is not established by ordinary-child benchmarks"
  ]
}
